sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant Page as index.astro (CureVa)
    participant MJS as booking.mangomint.com/app.js
    participant MAPI as Mangomint SaaS<br/>(CompanyId 463532)

    B->>Page: GET / (landing page)
    Page-->>B: HTML + window.Mangomint.CompanyId=463532
    Page->>MJS: load app.js (async, non-blocking)
    MJS->>MJS: Scan DOM for booking.mangomint.com links
    MJS-->>B: Attach handler -> turn links into popup triggers

    B->>MJS: Click "Book now"
    alt app.js loaded
        MJS->>MAPI: Open popup iframe (in-page overlay)
        MAPI-->>B: Booking UI (services / time)
    else app.js not loaded yet
        Note over B: No JS hijack -> fallback to href
        B->>MAPI: GET booking.mangomint.com/463532 (full page)
    end
